//*
# A poem from two questions

An agent may ask a person with its `askHuman` tool.

    spl run examples/color-poem.spl
*//

---
model: gpt-6-luna
---

---
mode: agent

Ask the human "What is your favorite color?" ->[Str] @color
Ask the human "What is your favorite fruit?" ->[Str] @fruit
---

---
outputVar: poem

A paragraph long poem about @color and @fruit
---

success({ poem });
